# STYLE 01 — EDITORIAL LUXURY

### Visual
- Warm ivory / cream background
- High-contrast editorial serif
- Minimal sans-serif metadata
- Hairline borders
- Large negative space
- Very soft shadow

### Product
- 75–85% viewport height
- Center or slightly asymmetric
- Can visually overflow the editorial frame

### Typography
```text
Product name: 42–64px serif
Metadata:      10–13px sans-serif
Price:         16–20px
Tracking:      0.08–0.15em
```

### Motion
- Product: scale 1.03 → 1.00
- Text: fade + translateY 12–16px
- Background: static

### Signature
Large editorial typography partially overlaps or sits behind the bouquet.

