# STYLE 02 — MINIMAL CLEAN

### Visual
- Off-white / white background
- Modern sans-serif
- Almost no decoration
- No visible card border
- Minimal controls

### Product
- Center aligned
- 70–80% viewport height
- Maximum visual clarity

### Typography
```text
Heading: 32–44px
Body:    12–14px
Price:   16–18px
```

### Effects
- Soft contact shadow
- No glow
- No particles
- No complex background

### Motion
- Very smooth scale transition
- Minimal card rotation

### Signature
Extreme negative space around the bouquet.

