# STYLE 03 — CINEMATIC DARK

### Visual
- Near-black background
- Deep burgundy / red / gold accents
- High contrast
- Cinematic lighting
- Dark vignette

### Product
- Large central composition
- Strong visual separation from background

### Effects
- Rim light
- Soft ambient glow
- Deep contact shadow
- Subtle light streak

### Typography
```text
Heading: 36–52px serif
Metadata: 10–12px uppercase
Price: 16–20px
```

### Motion
- Background light follows finger movement
- Product moves slightly slower than card
- Swipe creates directional light streak

### Signature
Bouquet appears to sit inside a dark photographic studio.

