# STYLE 04 — ROMANTIC PASTEL

### Visual
- Blush pink
- Peach
- Cream
- Lavender
- Soft coral

### Background
Use blurred radial gradients and soft color fields.

### Product
- Center
- 65–80% viewport height

### Effects
- Soft bokeh
- Floating petals
- Very subtle glow

### Typography
- Elegant serif
- Optional script accent

### Motion
- Petals move according to swipe direction
- Background gradient slowly shifts
- Product remains stable

