# STYLE 05 — BOTANICAL FRAME

### Visual
- Ivory / warm paper background
- Fine botanical line art
- Editorial serif typography
- Thin decorative borders

### Frame
Botanical elements positioned primarily at:
- corners
- side edges
- upper/lower margins

Decorative elements must occupy <10% visual weight.

### Product
- Center
- 70–80% viewport height

### Effects
- SVG leaves / branches
- Fine line illustrations
- Very subtle texture

### Motion
Botanical elements reveal or move slightly when the card enters.

### Signature
Delicate botanical border surrounding the product without competing with it.

