# STYLE 06 — GLASSMORPHISM

### Visual
- Product/background image environment
- Transparent glass information panel
- Blur
- Soft highlights
- Modern typography

### Glass Panel
```css
background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.20);
border-radius: 20–28px;
```

### Product
- Large behind/around glass panel
- Panel should not cover more than ~35% of product

### Motion
- Product and panel move at slightly different speeds
- Reflection shifts with pointer/finger movement

### Signature
Foreground glass layer creates depth between product and UI.

