# COMMON VISUAL TOKENS

## Border Radius

```text
Minimal:        0–12px
Modern:         16–24px
Glass:          20–28px
Editorial:      0–8px
```

## Shadow

```text
Soft:
0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.10)

Medium:
0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.16)
```

Avoid hard shadows.

## Product Scale

Default:

```text
65–85% viewport height
```

Allow template-specific variation.

## UI Controls

Minimum touch target:

```text
44 × 44px
```

Default actions:

```text
Reject / Skip
Favorite
Next
```

Controls should inherit each template's visual language.

