# TEMPLATE CONFIGURATION MODEL

Each style should be represented as a configuration rather than a separate application.

```typescript
type TemplateStyle = {
  id: string;
  name: string;

  background: {
    type: string;
    color?: string;
    gradient?: string;
  };

  typography: {
    heading: string;
    body: string;
    accent?: string;
  };

  product: {
    scale: number;
    positionX: number;
    positionY: number;
    rotation?: number;
  };

  effects: {
    shadow: boolean;
    glow: boolean;
    blur: boolean;
    particles: boolean;
    parallax: boolean;
    glass: boolean;
    botanical: boolean;
  };

  layout: {
    titlePosition: string;
    pricePosition: string;
    controlsPosition: string;
  };

  motion: {
    cardDuration: number;
    entranceDuration: number;
    parallaxIntensity: number;
  };
};
```

