# IMPLEMENTATION RULE

Build **one Swipe Brochure Engine**.

Do NOT build 12 independent pages.

Architecture:

```text
                 PRODUCT DATA
                      ↓
              SWIPE ENGINE
                      ↓
             TEMPLATE ENGINE
                      ↓
       ┌──────┬──────┬──────┐
       ↓      ↓      ↓      ↓
     Style 01 Style 02 ... Style 12
       ↓      ↓      ↓      ↓
             SAME PRODUCT
```

The only differences between templates should be:

- visual composition
- typography
- colors
- background treatment
- decorative layers
- product positioning
- shadow/light treatment
- motion treatment

The following must remain shared:

- product data
- image assets
- swipe gesture
- card stack
- favorites
- navigation
- product detail
- analytics
- preload/cache
- responsive behavior

---

# QUALITY BAR

The final result should NOT look like:

- generic ecommerce cards
- standard Bootstrap cards
- ordinary florist websites
- excessive 3D effects
- AI-generated flower artwork
- overloaded UI

The visual target is:

**premium mobile editorial + authentic product photography + Tinder-like interaction.**

The product image must always remain the visual hero.